Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:03.98,ПРЕДСТ,,0,0,0,,ФАНСАБ-ГРУППА АЗАЛИИ ПРЕДСТАВЛЯЕТ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\fade(00,0)\p1\a5\bord0\1a&H00&\pos(430,206)\fscx807\fscy277}m 0 0 l 0 0 l 92 0 l 92 38 l 0 38
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:03.98,worked,,0,0,0,,{\pos(801,256)}Worked on the series:\N Lily, Tiramisu, Biryulka, Host, Singer, February
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:03.98,title,,0,0,0,,{\fscx75\fscy75\pos(846,392)}How I became
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:03.98,name,,0,0,0,,{\fscx75\fscy75\pos(848,456)}queen
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.06,2:01:37.06,PRESENT,,0,0,0,,{\fs40\pos(1181,4)}AZALEA
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.96,0:01:06.46,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,All characters are fictitious,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.46,0:01:08.66,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,and the events shown are fiction.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.70,0:01:18.84,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,They say an arrow doesn't fly straight when you're anxious.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.07,0:01:22.94,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,11 episode
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.39,0:01:37.26,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I apologize for asking for such a late meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.42,0:01:39.33,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.66,0:01:41.09,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,You need me,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.09,0:01:42.56,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,and I'm grateful for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.70,0:01:46.73,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,If only this was a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.73,0:01:51.57,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,If only everything would disappear when I wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.68,0:01:58.25,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I have something for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.03,0:02:15.76,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Secret
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.08,0:02:37.15,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Immerse the queen in the nightmare in which I live.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.46,0:02:49.70,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,My king.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.00,0:02:56.27,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Last night you came to me in a dream
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.97,0:03:00.51,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,and a huge power fell into my hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.16,0:03:18.53,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Queen's Dictionary
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.50,0:03:26.40,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Social distancing
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.17,0:03:32.84,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,amazing, time of magic, hungry for attention,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.84,0:03:36.34,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,showdown, jasmine tea, rude
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.36,0:03:53.03,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Cuties.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.43,0:03:57.46,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.60,0:04:03.14,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Lost your voice, call me hoarse?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.71,0:04:09.78,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.81,0:04:14.85,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.52,0:04:19.05,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Is the water warm enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.22,0:04:21.96,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Is the water warm enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.46,0:04:26.19,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.19,0:04:28.70,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Why the hell did you forget here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.47,0:04:34.60,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,My queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.74,0:04:38.97,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Today
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.34,0:04:42.18,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,no social distancing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.72,0:04:55.42,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, are you awake?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.66,0:05:00.69,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.19,0:05:03.70,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Why do you look so scary?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.00,0:05:06.73,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,How dare you ruin my erotic dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.93,0:05:09.37,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Call him immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.74,0:05:10.90,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.81,0:05:12.97,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Call...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.58,0:05:16.71,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Who should we call?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.05,0:05:28.49,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Queen's Dictionary
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.19,0:05:31.42,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,You are in a good mood, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.86,0:05:35.13,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Slept all night without waking up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.33,0:05:38.63,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Start preparing for the feast.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.87,0:05:40.93,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.07,0:05:50.44,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,11 episode. The one who cannot be forgiven
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.55,0:05:52.61,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.85,0:05:55.42,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I had a nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.85,0:05:57.95,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,But worse than this nightmare is,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.95,0:05:59.49,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,that I didn’t like him
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.89,0:06:03.02,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,and liked it at the same time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.39,0:06:06.29,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I don’t know if I feel it or my body.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.16,0:06:10.53,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,It feels like I was pieced together.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.43,0:06:12.50,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.63,0:06:16.90,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,It’s like I turned into a Lego constructor.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.30,0:06:20.57,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Who the hell am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.71,0:06:24.61,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,But why
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.45,0:06:28.42,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,are you calling me “doctor”?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.25,0:06:31.08,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,You interrupted me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.08,0:06:33.49,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Just listen. This is by the way necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.19,0:06:40.16,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,So what is the expert's opinion?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.53,0:06:45.07,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Changes in the body are side effects of a vegetative state.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.33,0:06:47.40,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,So is this normal?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.70,0:06:52.71,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Nothing unusual.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.21,0:06:57.48,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Quite comforting, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.91,0:07:01.75,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,At your words, the anxiety began to disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.58,0:07:06.22,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,He who heals without acupuncture -
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.52,0:07:08.25,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,great healer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.16,0:07:10.19,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,It turned out that
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.92,0:07:14.13,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,royal physician and expert in psychology.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.56,0:07:19.17,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,So when is my mixed two-faced state
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.17,0:07:20.53,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,will you let me go?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.77,0:07:23.27,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,All problems are connected with your heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.40,0:07:26.67,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,As soon as you accept this, the worries will go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.67,0:07:29.81,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,You can start living again without worries.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.81,0:07:33.58,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Should I accept myself as I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.22,0:07:40.09,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Reasonable. The only constant thing about me is my contradiction.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.22,0:07:42.26,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,By the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.99,0:07:45.56,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,The herbs for the cover of beauty were magnificent.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.29,0:07:48.53,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Use them,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.53,0:07:50.73,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,to create a facial product.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.50,0:07:53.20,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Elasticity, radiance and brightening.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.20,0:07:55.57,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,The purpose should attract attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.57,0:07:57.60,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Needed every 28 days, make more.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.74,0:08:01.17,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Why 28 days?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.17,0:08:02.48,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,This is how much the skin is renewed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.98,0:08:04.61,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,When her skin becomes keratinized,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.61,0:08:05.98,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,she will need me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.81,0:08:08.21,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.45,0:08:11.45,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Mr. Youngjin has come to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.56,0:08:19.59,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Is this really the maid Hwajin?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.89,0:08:21.80,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,She is sure of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.06,0:08:26.97,Default,Lilia,0,0,0,,But I hope that Ovol herself sold the noriga.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.20,0:08:28.94,Default,Lilia,0,0,0,,Hwajin was probably upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.37,0:08:32.07,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,We need to pay her a visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.37,0:08:37.34,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Your Majesty. The main concubine requests an audience.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.38,0:08:38.51,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Let him come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.48,0:08:43.48,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Concubine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.49,0:08:52.59,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.50,0:08:57.70,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I drew Ovol.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.43,0:09:01.60,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,That’s exactly how I remembered her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.97,0:09:03.07,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I'm sure,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.94,0:09:05.77,Default,Lilia,0,0,0,,that Ovol herself sold to noriga.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.17,0:09:08.01,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,She wouldn’t end up like that in the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.61,0:09:11.28,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,You can be sure of the picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.05,0:09:17.32,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.08,0:09:19.15,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.66,0:09:28.16,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I just found out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.03,0:09:31.46,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,You had a hard time last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.13,0:09:36.34,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I spent the whole night collecting my thoughts, don’t worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.77,0:09:41.88,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I need to tell you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.04,0:09:47.68,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,This concerns your feelings for the queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.31,0:09:49.68,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,It’s harder to overcome yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.45,0:09:53.72,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,than to overcome another person. Therefore
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.02,0:09:56.56,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,give in to your feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.06,0:10:01.69,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I don’t need your apology.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.34,0:10:20.21,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.65,0:10:23.25,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,It’s only been a day since I returned to the palace,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.25,0:10:24.85,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,so okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.85,0:10:27.72,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,However, I will be busy selecting concubines.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.72,0:10:29.56,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Selection of concubines.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.43,0:10:36.90,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Arriving at my chambers,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.50,0:10:40.13,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,have you noticed anything strange?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.67,0:10:43.67,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Anything strange?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.54,0:10:47.31,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I dragged the king from the well, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.71,0:10:49.51,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,No. Did something happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.68,0:10:51.85,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.88,0:10:57.02,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,You two visited me,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.02,0:10:58.92,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,without you the house seems empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.92,0:11:00.95,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,It seems that this is the whole point.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.19,0:11:04.02,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Will you see His Majesty?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.22,0:11:06.36,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Sort it out among yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.36,0:11:07.46,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Not worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.33,0:11:10.16,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I think he is busy preparing the feast.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.16,0:11:13.37,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, I brought\N a letter to the bride's house.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.60,0:11:16.24,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,You need to take care of business. I'll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.61,0:11:26.68,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.95,0:11:30.15,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Even if there are 100 concubines,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.48,0:11:33.09,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,they won’t dare
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.65,0:11:37.06,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,take the queen’s place.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.66,0:11:39.59,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Yes. Certainly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.73,0:11:42.70,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Please take care of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.27,0:11:46.90,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.71,0:11:56.74,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Han Siok
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.35,0:12:00.51,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Discard the Khan family.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.81,0:12:02.52,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,We can do without Romeo and Juliet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.95,0:12:05.39,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Have you brought the genealogies of the Han families?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.99,0:12:09.36,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Han from Pyeongsan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.56,0:12:12.99,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Khan from Hanyang.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.46,0:12:14.76,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Han from Anbyon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.16,0:12:17.56,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,-Khan from Yangju.\N-Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.70,0:12:21.43,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Are these all the bloodlines of the Han families?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.70,0:12:24.00,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Yes, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.10,0:12:26.61,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Damn it, there are a lot of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.61,0:12:32.58,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,This won’t work. I need to earn her favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.41,0:12:37.12,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Traveling Salesman. I need the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.82,0:12:40.45,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,-Salesman.\N-Home sales.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.19,0:12:46.09,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Is it already lunch time?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.59,0:12:51.90,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Time to pamper your skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.14,0:13:04.51,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,You are dazzling.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.71,0:13:09.32,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Just an unearthly glow.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.48,0:13:13.12,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Thanks to you, my day is filled with self-care.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.39,0:13:15.86,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I forgot about the selection of concubines.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.92,0:13:18.49,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,How are you coping?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.06,0:13:21.43,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I'm trying my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.43,0:13:24.40,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Of course. Talented in one thing, talented in everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.40,0:13:27.20,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,You are doing so well,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.20,0:13:28.97,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,that I trust you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.97,0:13:32.57,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,There is something that I
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.57,0:13:35.48,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,prepared it especially for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.71,0:13:39.51,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,If you powder your hair with this,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.51,0:13:41.28,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,you will look 10 years younger.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.65,0:13:43.05,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Hair powder.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.28,0:13:49.22,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,No need to apply mulberry juice
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.22,0:13:51.26,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,on my head every morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.16,0:13:53.83,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.60,0:13:58.23,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Powder gently.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.33,0:13:59.93,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Powder.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.27,0:14:05.91,Default,Second,0,0,0,,This is a completely different person.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.61,0:14:10.31,Default,Second,0,0,0,,She had more slanted eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.61,0:14:12.98,Default,Second,0,0,0,,Or maybe only the left eye was squinting?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.98,0:14:15.38,Default,Second,0,0,0,,How hungry I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.65,0:14:23.12,Default,Second,0,0,0,,Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.32,0:14:27.43,Default,Second,0,0,0,,The face is thin with chubby cheeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.83,0:14:29.50,Default,Second,0,0,0,,With a wide forehead
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.60,0:14:31.26,Default,Second,0,0,0,,and shining eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.36,0:14:32.97,Default,Second,0,0,0,,Something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.10,0:14:35.47,Default,Second,0,0,0,,Straight spout with a rounded tip.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.97,0:15:15.91,Default,Second,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, the royal cook has arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.68,0:15:20.28,Default,Second,0,0,0,,I think calamus liqueur will do. What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.75,0:15:21.81,Default,Second,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.18,0:15:25.49,Default,Second,0,0,0,,I got too carried away with my thoughts.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.79,0:15:27.95,Default,Second,0,0,0,,I’m thinking about which liqueur to choose for the feast.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.69,0:15:33.99,Default,Second,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, I have prepared something here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.04,0:15:45.00,Default,Second,0,0,0,,I deserve to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.65,0:16:02.86,Default,Second,0,0,0,,Relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.59,0:16:05.29,Default,Second,0,0,0,,Then everything will go smoothly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.56,0:16:07.99,Default,Second,0,0,0,,As you say.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.93,0:16:16.07,Default,Second,0,0,0,,Are you comfortable? Then watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.40,0:16:18.64,Default,Second,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.01,0:16:23.21,Default,Second,0,0,0,,This is a traditional feast plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.68,0:16:25.91,Default,Second,0,0,0,,I want to change it a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.28,0:16:30.05,Default,Second,0,0,0,,I want to reduce the number of dishes and remove
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.05,0:16:32.59,Default,Second,0,0,0,,a large unnecessary table with food in the middle.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.99,0:16:34.89,Default,Second,0,0,0,,-Excuse me, king.\N-Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.39,0:16:37.86,Default,Second,0,0,0,,Royal feast
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.86,0:16:40.66,Default,Second,0,0,0,,should be grandiose and luxurious.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.66,0:16:42.43,Default,Second,0,0,0,,No matter how unnecessary...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.80,0:16:45.06,Default,Second,0,0,0,,Are you out of your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.47,0:16:51.90,Default,Second,0,0,0,,My people are suffering from hunger.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.21,0:16:54.07,Default,Second,0,0,0,,Will I translate food for fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.27,0:16:56.58,Default,Second,0,0,0,,Then the food that we will prepare,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.68,0:17:00.48,Default,The second,0,0,0,,we will give to the starving outside the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.28,0:17:06.29,Default,Second,0,0,0,,Modest, but not stingy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.85,0:17:09.62,Default,Second,0,0,0,,Exquisite, but not pretentious.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.99,0:17:11.52,Default,Second,0,0,0,,I want such a feast.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.63,0:17:20.83,Default,Second,0,0,0,,I'll do my best in the next 2 weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.60,0:17:25.67,Default,Second,0,0,0,,I hope we can work together.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.14,0:17:33.18,Default,Second,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.12,0:17:40.39,Default,Second,0,0,0,,Is it so easy to make a man cry?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.43,0:17:50.76,Default,Second,0,0,0,,I can’t even believe it,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.76,0:17:53.07,Default,Second,0,0,0,,such a detailed accounting of the sources of bribes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.63,0:17:57.94,Default,Second,0,0,0,,The queen's father is more meticulous than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.37,0:18:02.34,Default,Second,0,0,0,,The enemy of the royal concubine Cho\N is not the Kim clan, but the queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.08,0:18:06.48,Default,Second,0,0,0,,So she couldn’t see the big picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.39,0:18:19.19,Default,Second,0,0,0,,We must properly manage the ledger.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.19,0:18:21.66,Default,Second,0,0,0,,And then we will destroy the Kim family
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.09,0:18:25.06,Default,Second,0,0,0,,and we will overthrow the queen from the throne.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.27,0:18:32.41,Default,Second,0,0,0,,Account book?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.91,0:18:36.51,Default,Second,0,0,0,,What was he thinking? How could he store something so dangerous?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.51,0:18:37.68,Default,Second,0,0,0,,I must...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.78,0:18:42.38,Default,Second,0,0,0,,Keep this a secret for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.38,0:18:44.38,Default,Second,0,0,0,,If others in the family find out, they will make a fuss.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.38,0:18:47.15,Default,Second,0,0,0,,How so. What an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.79,0:18:49.89,Default,Second,0,0,0,,And yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.99,0:18:52.83,Default,Second,0,0,0,,Who do you think has the book?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.83,0:18:55.49,Default,Second,0,0,0,,The king spent 2 days in his house,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.49,0:18:57.66,Default,Second,0,0,0,,he ignored the demand to return to the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.66,0:18:58.70,Default,Second,0,0,0,,So,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.30,0:19:01.33,Default,Second,0,0,0,,king?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.20,0:19:06.61,Default,Second,0,0,0,,He wants to reveal us during the feast on the Day of the Cart.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.01,0:19:08.91,Default,Second,0,0,0,,Maybe the weapon is in his hands,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.81,0:19:12.88,Default,Second,0,0,0,,but we must weaken it so that it does not take advantage of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.45,0:19:15.75,Default,Second,0,0,0,,Kim Moon-geun thinks,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.75,0:19:19.55,Default,Second,0,0,0,,that I was the only suspect left.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.55,0:19:22.15,Default,Second,0,0,0,,But he cannot ask the king if he stole the book.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.52,0:19:23.76,Default,Second,0,0,0,,It must be hard for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.59,0:19:27.36,Default,Second,0,0,0,,Have we already found out who was hiding behind the mask?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.36,0:19:28.83,Default,Second,0,0,0,,In the Detective Department
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.83,0:19:30.70,Default,Second,0,0,0,,no one has a scar on their cheek.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.50,0:19:33.87,Default,Second,0,0,0,,Even if we do not receive the ledger,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.37,0:19:37.37,Default,Second,0,0,0,,we must prepare a conspiracy to achieve our goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.30,0:19:40.84,Default,Second,0,0,0,,Have you studied the position of other genera?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.88,0:19:53.32,Default,Second,0,0,0,,The Law of Five Seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.82,0:19:56.59,Default,Second,0,0,0,,Five seconds are enough to fall in love.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.13,0:20:01.59,Default,Second,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, everyone is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.59,0:20:03.13,Default,Second,0,0,0,,-Is that all?\N-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.40,0:20:09.50,Default,Second,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.00,0:20:12.04,Default,Second,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.71,0:20:17.08,Default,Second,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.81,0:20:19.11,Default,Second,0,0,0,,Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.11,0:20:21.48,Default,Second,0,0,0,,A spark jumped between me and...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.66,0:20:30.86,Default,Second,0,0,0,,I liked this one too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.66,0:20:41.60,Default,Second,0,0,0,,Miss Yun, you are so lovely, maybe tell us more about yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.50,0:20:47.71,Default,Second,0,0,0,,There is a beautiful mountain in my hometown.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.17,0:20:50.01,Default,Second,0,0,0,,Called Mount Kamaksan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.21,0:20:52.38,Default,Second,0,0,0,,-Kamaksan?\N-Yes, queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.51,0:20:56.12,Default,Second,0,0,0,,Simply amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.12,0:20:57.22,Default,Second,0,0,0,,-Amazing?\N-Amazing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.59,0:21:00.65,Default,Second,0,0,0,,-Your Majesty.\N-Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.65,0:21:03.59,Default,Second,0,0,0,,There is a large palace in my city.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.59,0:21:05.76,Default,Second,0,0,0,,It was built by King Jeongjo.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.76,0:21:08.29,Default,Second,0,0,0,,You can only brag about Hwaseong Palace?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.83,0:21:12.13,Default,Second,0,0,0,,Only talk about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.63,0:21:15.07,Default,Second,0,0,0,,You can brag about one more thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.07,0:21:17.90,Default,Second,0,0,0,,if you become a concubine, Mrs. Hong.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.17,0:21:21.07,Default,Second,0,0,0,,Queen, thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.98,0:21:27.18,Default,Second,0,0,0,,In my hometown there are whole fields of peach trees.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.18,0:21:29.38,Default,Second,0,0,0,,During the flowering period
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.12,0:21:31.75,Default,Second,0,0,0,,there is no place more magnificent.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.89,0:21:36.62,Default,Second,0,0,0,,My mother dreamed of peaches when I was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.12,0:21:39.06,Default,Second,0,0,0,,Not surprising.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.06,0:21:41.23,Default,Second,0,0,0,,If you can compare someone to a peach,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.59,0:21:44.60,Default,Second,0,0,0,,so just you, Mrs. Min.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.73,0:21:48.63,Default,Second,0,0,0,,My peach.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.24,0:21:52.40,Default,Second,0,0,0,,If you win these three kinds to your side,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.81,0:21:57.78,Default,Second,0,0,0,,then there will be a dragon and two phoenixes on your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.18,0:22:01.21,Default,Second,0,0,0,,And then you can conquer the white tiger.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.29,0:22:10.49,Default,Second,0,0,0,,While Hwaseong Palace guards the gates,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.62,0:22:13.86,Default,Second,0,0,0,,the landscapes of Mount Camaksan delight my eyes,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.56,0:22:19.23,Default,Second,0,0,0,,and the sweet aroma of peach fills my chambers.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.12,0:22:39.99,Default,Second,0,0,0,,Phapyeong clan Yun. Namyan clan Hon.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.55,0:22:41.79,Default,Second,0,0,0,,Johyn clan Min.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.19,0:22:44.06,Default,Second,0,0,0,,Excellent balance of power.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.83,0:22:50.06,Default,Second,0,0,0,,Innocent, sexy and sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.50,0:22:51.93,Default,Second,0,0,0,,True harmony.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.84,0:23:00.67,Default,Second,0,0,0,,Yun Gyonok from the Phapyeong family of Yun.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.44,0:23:03.21,Default,Second,0,0,0,,Min Jayon from the Yohyn clan of Min.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.94,0:23:06.01,Default,Second,0,0,0,,Khon Simkhyan from the Namyang family of Khon.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.75,0:23:10.18,Default,Second,0,0,0,,I appoint you as concubines of the second rank.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.82,0:23:18.09,Default,Second,0,0,0,,These three concubines and their families join the royal family.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.66,0:23:21.33,Default,Second,0,0,0,,Tell your families
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.33,0:23:23.93,Default,Second,0,0,0,,invitation to a feast on Cart Day.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.40,0:23:27.50,Default,Second,0,0,0,,-Thank you, Your Majesty.\N-Thank you, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.74,0:23:34.27,Default,Second,0,0,0,,Well, finally.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.07,0:23:37.74,Default,Second,0,0,0,,The king began to gather allies around himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.28,0:23:40.45,Default,Second,0,0,0,,But they will break all ties with him,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.45,0:23:42.62,Default,Second,0,0,0,,as soon as they find out how weak he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.68,0:23:48.62,Default,Second,0,0,0,,The king insisted on holding a feast.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.89,0:23:50.16,Default,Second,0,0,0,,Is this what he wanted?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.42,0:23:54.33,Default,Second,0,0,0,,-I hope you are getting ready.\N-Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.20,0:24:05.24,Default,Second,0,0,0,,More!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.74,0:24:11.28,Default,Second,0,0,0,,Everyone probably desperately wants to know what’s behind the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.88,0:24:15.38,Default,Second,0,0,0,,They do it so well.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.58,0:24:17.88,Default,Second,0,0,0,,The Queen Mother is coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.05,0:24:24.79,Default,Second,0,0,0,,Hope you are doing well, Queen Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.29,0:24:29.63,Default,Second,0,0,0,,Long time no see, royal concubine Cho.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.96,0:24:33.43,Default,Third,0,0,0,,Hello, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.14,0:24:39.10,Default,Third,0,0,0,,If you allow me, I will leave you, I want to practice shooting.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.45,0:24:49.52,Default,Third,0,0,0,,You've been here for a long time
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.52,0:24:51.22,Default,Third,0,0,0,,came to her senses after an illness.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.22,0:24:53.19,Default,Third,0,0,0,,But she never visited me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.89,0:24:56.36,Default,Third,0,0,0,,I was busy selecting spouses
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.36,0:24:57.79,Default,Third,0,0,0,,for His Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.79,0:25:00.46,Default,Third,0,0,0,,Forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.06,0:25:04.70,Default,Third,0,0,0,,For someone who has faced death, you are very fresh.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.20,0:25:08.30,Default,Third,0,0,0,,I never complained about my health.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.97,0:25:12.62,Default,Third,0,0,0,,So you give up,\Nyou won't hunt on Cart Day?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.04,0:25:15.31,Default,Third,0,0,0,,Instead of training with a bow
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.47,0:25:17.28,Default,Third,0,0,0,,you're having fun here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.28,0:25:19.28,Default,Third,0,0,0,,Royal consort Cho will win anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.28,0:25:21.41,Default,Third,0,0,0,,I decided to enjoy the holiday.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.25,0:25:24.35,Default,Third,0,0,0,,Maybe I'm good at stalking "prey"
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.35,0:25:26.39,Default,Third,0,0,0,,but hunting is not my thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.32,0:25:28.49,Default,Third,0,0,0,,Persecution?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.49,0:25:29.96,Default,Third,0,0,0,,You know,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.96,0:25:33.03,Default,Third,0,0,0,,why do the young girls of the courtyard participate in the hunt
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.03,0:25:34.63,Default,Third,0,0,0,,on Cart Day?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.63,0:25:37.96,Default,Third,0,0,0,,No, not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.00,0:25:45.64,Default,Third,0,0,0,,On this day we drive away evil spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.17,0:25:47.91,Default,Third,0,0,0,,Before, the evil spirit was cast out
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.91,0:25:49.61,Default,Third,0,0,0,,blood of the slain.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.11,0:25:53.48,Default,Third,0,0,0,,But instead we hunt animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.52,0:26:06.13,Default,Third,0,0,0,,Actually, a body was found in the well of the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.73,0:26:08.84,Default,Third,0,0,0,,It is said that this court lady \Nserved Concubine Cho.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.53,0:26:10.63,Default,Third,0,0,0,,In the well?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.36,0:26:13.90,Default,Third,0,0,0,,How?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.33,0:26:16.37,Default,Third,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.37,0:26:18.20,Default,Third,0,0,0,,-Come to us.\N-Come to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.67,0:26:19.91,Default,Third,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.75,0:26:29.11,Default,Third,0,0,0,,-Wow.\N-Incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.58,0:26:31.95,Default,Third,0,0,0,,Her Majesty is a master.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.02,0:26:36.32,Default,Third,0,0,0,,Triple Axel.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.51,0:26:52.41,Default,Third,0,0,0,,I can’t sleep and toss and turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.88,0:26:58.09,Default,Third,0,0,0,,Perhaps I should write a message to my dear concubines?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.39,0:27:03.13,Default,Third,0,0,0,,What should I write?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.06,0:27:08.13,Default,Third,0,0,0,,A simple beginning does not oblige you to anything, but evokes emotions.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.40,0:27:10.47,Default,Third,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.19,0:27:34.12,Default,Third,0,0,0,,Deliver it to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.72,0:27:35.76,Default,Third,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.39,0:27:37.39,Default,Third,0,0,0,,Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.06,0:27:40.76,Default,Third,0,0,0,,Order to keep your eyes peeled to see if the king will appear.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.50,0:27:42.53,Default,Third,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.14,0:27:49.14,Default,Third,0,0,0,,One message for each spouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.14,0:27:50.97,Default,Third,0,0,0,,-And check where the king is.\N-And check where the king is.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.97,0:27:52.71,Default,Third,0,0,0,,One message for spouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.71,0:27:54.14,Default,Third,0,0,0,,And check where the king is.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.25,0:28:00.38,Default,Third,0,0,0,,To you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.05,0:28:04.59,Default,Third,0,0,0,,Come on in.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.42,0:28:07.22,Default,Third,0,0,0,,One message for the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.22,0:28:08.99,Default,Third,0,0,0,,And check where the spouses are.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.99,0:28:10.06,Default,Third,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.06,0:28:12.06,Default,Third,0,0,0,,-One message for the king.\N-Something has changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.06,0:28:13.86,Default,Third,0,0,0,,And check where the spouses are.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.13,0:28:20.44,Default,Third,0,0,0,,"Are you sleeping?"
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.17,0:28:22.30,Default,Third,0,0,0,,Are you sleeping?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.14,0:28:25.21,Default,Third,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.01,0:28:30.05,Default,Third,0,0,0,,"Are you sleeping?"
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.22,0:28:37.32,Default,Third,0,0,0,,"Are you sleeping?"
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.89,0:28:44.43,Default,Third,0,0,0,,Why is she so interested in whether I’m sleeping or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.33,0:28:46.93,Default,Third,0,0,0,,I asked three times.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.34,0:28:54.80,Default,Third,0,0,0,,The answer has arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.64,0:28:58.64,Default,Third,0,0,0,,I sent 3, why is there only one answer?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.41,0:29:02.64,Default,Third,0,0,0,,Do they write novels for me there?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.95,0:29:09.38,Default,Third,0,0,0,,Well, let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.29,0:29:14.39,Default,Third,0,0,0,,What beautiful handwriting.\NThat’s what it means to be from a good family.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.03,0:29:19.66,Default,Third,0,0,0,,On a sleepless night I walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.93,0:29:24.07,Default,Third,0,0,0,,Light breaks through the dark night sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.03,0:29:28.74,Default,Third,0,0,0,,I raise my head - maybe it’s the moon?\NNo, this is my dear friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.74,0:29:32.91,Default,Third,0,0,0,,Spanish shame.\NBut it touches the soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.64,0:29:35.64,Default,Third,0,0,0,,We must then too...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.54,0:30:02.30,Default,Third,0,0,0,,-Hon Young.\N-Yes, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.54,0:30:05.87,Default,Third,0,0,0,,This is the answer. Deliver it to the sender of that letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.48,0:30:09.11,Default,Third,0,0,0,,I think about many things.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.11,0:30:11.21,Default,Third,0,0,0,,With a happy heart I drown in thoughts of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.21,0:30:13.92,Default,Third,0,0,0,,Please, row to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.52,0:30:18.99,Default,Third,0,0,0,,I didn’t let go of thoughts about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.86,0:30:22.96,Default,Third,0,0,0,,My queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.23,0:30:30.47,Default,Third,0,0,0,,So the knowledge from the introductory course came in handy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.93,0:30:34.00,Default,Third,0,0,0,,Great, that’s how I’ll get my masculinity back.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.14,0:30:37.21,Default,Third,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.95,0:31:27.39,Default,Third,0,0,0,,Follow the same recipe,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.89,0:31:29.73,Default,Third,0,0,0,,but it’s better to replace the croaker
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.16,0:31:32.23,Default,Third,0,0,0,,for bream.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.23,0:31:33.23,Default,Third,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.26,0:31:38.23,Default,Third,0,0,0,,Get some inspiration for your poems and letters?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.90,0:31:40.04,Default,Third,0,0,0,,My queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.60,0:31:41.70,Default,Third,0,0,0,,Holy shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.07,0:31:43.14,Default,Third,0,0,0,,Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.81,0:31:45.64,Default,Third,0,0,0,,You! I told you you can't come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.14,0:31:47.24,Default,Third,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.38,0:31:48.74,Default,Third,0,0,0,,I acted like we were a couple,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.74,0:31:50.65,Default,Third,0,0,0,,since it was an official event.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.65,0:31:53.02,Default,Third,0,0,0,,For me now it is very important to find myself again.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.02,0:31:54.12,Default,Third,0,0,0,,Please do not interfere.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.62,0:31:55.62,Default,Third,0,0,0,,Rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.62,0:31:56.65,Default,Third,0,0,0,,What is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.49,0:32:00.22,Default,Third,0,0,0,,How can she transform like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.62,0:32:04.73,Default,Third,0,0,0,,The Queen is shyer than she seems.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.90,0:32:11.80,Default,Third,0,0,0,,The list of dishes for the ceremony is ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.67,0:32:13.77,Default,Third,0,0,0,,Nice job.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.77,0:32:18.57,Default,Third,0,0,0,,Have you checked the list of offerings for the ceremony?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.94,0:32:20.48,Default,Third,0,0,0,,Here is the list.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.48,0:32:22.41,Default,Third,0,0,0,,Why do they all say “bone-on”?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.71,0:32:26.95,Default,Third,0,0,0,,The list of dishes is the menu.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.18,0:32:30.29,Default,Third,0,0,0,,The list of offerings is a list of things for the ritual.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.85,0:32:32.15,Default,Third,0,0,0,,What's the matter with you, Your Majesty?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.25,0:32:34.39,Default,Third,0,0,0,,Really? So am I a deaf pervert?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.56,0:32:39.29,Default,Third,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.30,0:32:45.27,Default,Third,0,0,0,,You work so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.27,0:32:47.87,Default,Third,0,0,0,,Go rest, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.64,0:32:49.77,Default,Third,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.71,0:32:52.27,Default,Third,0,0,0,,No time. Let's continue.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.48,0:32:55.74,Default,Third,0,0,0,,I almost felt sorry for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.81,0:32:58.91,Default,Third,0,0,0,,Not the point. Today I will write a letter more angrily.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.55,0:33:01.02,Default,Third,0,0,0,,Boner is a dangerous word according to Freud.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.02,0:33:03.15,Default,Third,0,0,0,,His nosebleed is clearly not from work.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.32,0:33:09.96,Default,Third,0,0,0,,With your name on my lips I will die!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.29,0:33:13.33,Default,Third,0,0,0,,It will remain in my memory - do not forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.00,0:33:17.07,Default,Third,0,0,0,,How can she be one night and another during the day?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.73,0:33:20.34,Default,Third,0,0,0,,Can’t decide whether to forgive me
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.34,0:33:21.90,Default,Third,0,0,0,,or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.65,0:33:33.15,Default,Third,0,0,0,,I am not sorry for my broken heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.85,0:33:36.32,Default,Third,0,0,0,,Is there a road along which we can walk together?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.63,0:33:48.20,Default,Third,0,0,0,,I hope that next time we\Nwill follow it from the very beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.63,0:33:51.20,Default,Third,0,0,0,,Even in dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.48,0:34:08.22,Default,Third,0,0,0,,Practicing with a sword at night?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.45,0:34:10.32,Default,Third,0,0,0,,One abnormal person is enough for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.32,0:34:12.65,Default,Third,0,0,0,,We need to prepare for the battle for the holiday.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.12,0:34:14.96,Default,Third,0,0,0,,Well, then train with someone from Syskny.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.49,0:34:20.60,Default,Third,0,0,0,,How do you rate your sword skills?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.80,0:34:21.96,Default,Third,0,0,0,,I don’t know.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.10,0:34:24.27,Default,Third,0,0,0,,I never gave it my all.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.80,0:34:27.50,Default,Third,0,0,0,,That’s why I need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.34,0:34:30.17,Default,Third,0,0,0,,An enemy whose strength is unknown to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.34,0:35:07.34,Default,Third,0,0,0,,Day of the Cart
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.44,0:35:08.94,Default,Third,0,0,0,,Long life and good luck
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.68,0:35:17.72,Default,Third,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.83,0:35:31.53,Default,Third,0,0,0,,The weather is fine, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.53,0:35:32.97,Default,Third,0,0,0,,Really? This is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.97,0:35:35.43,Default,Third,0,0,0,,I hate it when it rains on the days of sports matches.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.24,0:35:41.11,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,My father will come. Therefore, you need to be even more chic.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.28,0:35:44.05,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,This is the first day when I will appear in front of everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.05,0:35:45.48,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,Pay more attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.22,0:35:50.92,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,Yes. I'm beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.02,0:35:53.42,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,Everyone will stare at me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.27,0:36:09.24,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,Are you going to use \Nmetal tips?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.41,0:36:11.54,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,Today I need
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.48,0:36:16.88,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,catch a large animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.25,0:36:22.25,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,Okay, we need to deliver this quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.25,0:36:23.65,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,Move over.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.02,0:36:27.42,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,Hello, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.62,0:36:31.09,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,We have fresh food for the banquet in honor of Cart Day
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.09,0:36:32.96,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,and royal offerings.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.13,0:36:36.03,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,We need to hurry to the palace. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.53,0:36:38.90,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,-Do you have documents for them?\N-Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.73,0:36:40.84,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.01,0:37:18.81,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,Time to change clothes, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.71,0:37:20.71,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,Wait a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.14,0:37:24.05,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,Today is a very important day.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.78,0:37:28.42,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,We should at least try to predict the fate of these people.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.89,0:37:35.09,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,Well, let's see. Map for the Cho clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.97,0:37:46.20,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,Thojang is the lowest card in the game Thujong.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.20,0:37:47.60,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,Rabbit card.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.34,0:37:57.01,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,Well, luck is a relative thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.31,0:38:02.58,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,Come on. A card for our king.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.36,0:38:10.43,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.37,0:38:19.93,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,"Injeong." Ninth card.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.44,0:38:21.74,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,Will everything turn the other way around?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.07,0:38:27.71,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,And now the card for the queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.58,0:38:37.75,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,Dragon?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.49,0:38:41.49,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,Ojan, eighth card.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.76,0:38:47.43,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,I hate my fortune telling today.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.20,0:38:55.94,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,Queen
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.87,0:39:01.14,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,up to something again?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.98,0:39:04.65,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,The Queen Mother has arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.15,0:39:08.32,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,You could inform us in advance that you will visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.32,0:39:11.05,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,You don’t even hide your dislike for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.52,0:39:14.09,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,When I was queen,\Nsuch behavior was unheard of.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.52,0:39:15.66,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,Regardless of era
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.66,0:39:18.63,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,no daughter-in-law wants to be taken by surprise by her mother-in-law.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.63,0:39:20.93,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,Well, look at her, she snaps at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.06,0:39:27.14,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,I heard you're cooking for the Dowager Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.74,0:39:31.54,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,And she never even offered me a snack.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.24,0:39:33.51,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,You must be afraid
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.51,0:39:36.41,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,my husband’s grandmother is bigger than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.11,0:39:39.18,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,What are you saying, this is not so.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.18,0:39:42.42,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,The Queen Dowager takes very good care of herself,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.42,0:39:43.72,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,so he looks young.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.19,0:39:46.39,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,You can’t fool time.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.79,0:39:49.46,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,You need to think carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.89,0:39:52.99,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,I will live longer than the Dowager Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.66,0:39:58.47,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,I will serve you my food someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.47,0:40:00.07,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,I should try it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.90,0:40:04.87,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,I'm very curious about your cooking,\N which I've only heard about.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.87,0:40:07.04,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,No strength to wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.24,0:40:10.81,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,Right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.71,0:40:14.65,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,So my persecution by my mother-in-law began?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.50,0:40:31.37,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,Damn, this is infuriating.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.87,0:40:39.41,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,Where is she hiding?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.51,0:40:44.11,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,Royal Chef. I need corn syrup.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.11,0:40:47.28,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,And what should I do with a banquet without fresh food?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.68,0:40:50.62,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,All the guards near the cart are dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.62,0:40:51.75,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,What could I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.75,0:40:54.19,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,Oh my God. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.62,0:40:57.83,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,-Dried fish.\N-What?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.23,0:41:01.16,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,Dried fish. Dried fish!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.80,0:41:06.07,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,The royal chef is too busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.47,0:41:08.10,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,I can’t command him.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.54,0:41:12.57,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,Where is the grain syrup?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.79,0:41:32.23,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,On a sleepless night I walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.83,0:41:34.50,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,"On a sleepless night I walk"
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.90,0:41:37.53,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,Royal Chef! Royal Chef!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.53,0:41:39.80,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,-Your Majesty.\N-Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.80,0:41:41.00,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.94,0:41:44.01,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.52,0:42:02.42,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,These are valuable products. Everyone is rotten!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.66,0:42:04.63,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,They were probably stored incorrectly.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.03,0:42:08.30,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,I deserve to die, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.20,0:42:10.50,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,This can’t be.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.23,0:42:14.64,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,No one would have destroyed them,\N if their safety had been ensured.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.51,0:42:18.54,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,Royal Chef!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.51,0:42:20.51,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.14,0:42:22.18,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,We have problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.18,0:42:24.28,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,Someone added stones to the rice.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.51,0:42:27.32,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,-What?\N-We won’t be able to submit anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.38,0:42:32.09,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,Don't worry. Do everything you can on your part.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.85,0:42:36.52,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,I will do my best to get those products.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.99,0:42:40.03,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.24,0:42:51.47,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,God, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.51,0:42:55.21,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,Royal Chef! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.48,0:42:58.98,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,I need to show her how I carry food myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.41,0:43:01.55,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,This will make her feel better, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.22,0:43:12.46,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,The combination of sweet syrup and salt makes it
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.46,0:43:13.83,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,ideal sweet and salty dish.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.64,0:43:32.51,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,There I see a beautiful mountain...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.53,0:43:45.73,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,Director Han?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.50,0:43:48.50,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.50,0:43:50.50,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,How could you?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.38,0:44:09.88,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,My popcorn!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.05,0:44:14.12,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.49,0:44:19.13,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,What a bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.18,0:44:40.11,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,Where is the treat?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.48,0:44:41.68,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.69,0:44:52.76,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.13,0:44:58.67,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,Look forward to your life in the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.34,0:45:09.61,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,Given what is happening,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.61,0:45:11.28,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,you must get food,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.28,0:45:13.41,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,once you're done with martial arts.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.95,0:45:14.95,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.09,0:45:26.69,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,Thank you for inviting us to the banquet.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.90,0:45:29.90,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,You deserve to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.97,0:45:32.83,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,The concubines are doing well.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.50,0:45:35.20,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,I hope everything is okay with you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.34,0:45:36.60,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,-Yes.\N-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.07,0:45:40.07,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,In any case, have a nice day today.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.85,0:46:56.58,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,Has the Queen Mother arrived yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.12,0:46:58.62,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,I'll find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.33,0:47:11.90,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,Thought you ran away.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.00,0:47:13.20,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.70,0:47:17.41,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,If someone has committed a crime,\Nhe must be punished accordingly.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.57,0:47:19.74,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,Glad you're aware.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.18,0:47:23.71,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,The Queen sent me snacks this morning,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.71,0:47:26.58,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,and I started getting ready late because I tried them.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.72,0:47:28.98,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,Queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.92,0:47:39.03,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,I feel like I’m going to die, stuck between two fires.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.33,0:47:46.60,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,Some kind of misunderstanding again?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.97,0:47:51.81,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.17,0:48:29.91,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,The royal guards have prepared\N a martial arts display.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.23,0:48:49.60,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,Attention!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.46,0:48:51.70,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,First round.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.84,0:48:59.87,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,How dare he try \Nto harm the queen with that sword?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.95,0:49:06.08,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,Battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.44,0:50:38.17,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,Wow. The king was very well prepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.05,0:50:58.23,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,The Dowager Queen. It's time to hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.49,0:51:03.30,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,Your Majesty. \NIt's time to change into your hunting outfit.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.57,0:51:10.77,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,I will return, Dowager Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.77,0:51:14.88,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,I'll be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.59,0:52:08.53,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,First line, ready to fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.93,0:52:13.10,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.34,0:52:23.44,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.38,0:52:29.48,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.00,0:52:45.67,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,I thought it was just for show.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.82,0:53:12.06,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,Things are the main thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.33,0:53:16.80,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,I think I look cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.03,0:53:19.53,Default,Fourth,0,0,0,,I like it. I look cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.31,0:53:29.21,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,Why is she so combative?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.44,0:53:32.15,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,There are always those who take competitions so seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.51,0:53:34.82,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,What kind of look is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.42,0:53:39.49,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,1 point for a bird, 2 points for a rabbit,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.79,0:53:42.92,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,for a badger - 3 points, for a boar - 4,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.19,0:53:46.09,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,deer - 5 points, wolf - 7,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.16,0:53:50.20,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,bear - 9 and tiger - 10 points.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.20,0:53:51.23,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,Wolf, tiger, rabbit, deer.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.23,0:53:52.97,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,Each will be given 10 arrows.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.43,0:53:56.37,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,For the sake of a fair fight, your ladies of the court and maids
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.37,0:53:57.67,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,will not participate.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.61,0:54:00.21,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,That’s tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.64,0:54:02.04,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,Nowadays this would make people
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.04,0:54:03.48,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,sign the national petition.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.91,0:54:06.65,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,Then it's time to start.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.06,0:54:19.46,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,You can already leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.17,0:54:28.90,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,We just need to kill time here and come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.09,0:54:49.29,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,The shooting match today is so predictable.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.26,0:54:52.59,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,This is a battle for the honor of the family,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.06,0:54:55.80,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,but the queen doesn’t seem interested.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.03,0:54:59.63,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,I didn’t know you had time to worry about a joke fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.07,0:55:03.14,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,You may well see your son today.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.58,0:55:10.94,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,The time has come to present my gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.35,0:55:14.58,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,That night when the queen fell into a vegetative state,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.58,0:55:17.55,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,the royal concubine and the king were about to share a bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.95,0:55:19.95,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,The Queen has woken up
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.95,0:55:22.66,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,just a day after that.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.29,0:55:26.66,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,You mean she pretended,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.66,0:55:29.66,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,to stop them?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.23,0:55:33.97,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,The Queen put it all on the line,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.97,0:55:35.67,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,to win the heart of the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.24,0:55:37.87,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,Threw herself into the lake,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.87,0:55:40.24,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,protected the royal concubine from the sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.97,0:55:43.81,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,Sacrificed the last thing she had left.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.05,0:55:49.88,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,The queen rejected her family.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.16,0:56:02.63,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,I was bored, and you amused me.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.43,0:56:07.43,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,The king threw a feast for no reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.87,0:56:10.04,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,And the queen rushed to take away the concubines
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.04,0:56:12.54,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,of the most influential families.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.71,0:56:15.84,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,I chose those who can support the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.64,0:56:19.78,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,Today the king will reveal his true face,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.78,0:56:22.28,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,which is still hidden from officials.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.62,0:56:25.09,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,The face of a strong ruler.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.56,0:56:30.49,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,Do you understand now?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.16,0:56:33.86,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,The queen is at one with the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.86,0:56:37.50,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,Aren’t you afraid for your life, saying this?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.86,0:56:41.03,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,And you probably believed that the queen would never betray you.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.30,0:56:44.50,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,I'm very disappointed.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.91,0:56:47.21,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,Fell for her cheap tricks
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.21,0:56:48.84,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,and let themselves be fooled.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.48,0:56:52.21,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,Apparently, they have grown quite old.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.98,0:56:56.38,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,I will tear out these vile lips.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.38,0:56:59.65,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,The Queen pretended to faint, there is no sin on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.65,0:57:03.46,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,And I have nothing to be afraid of anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.46,0:57:10.46,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,Why did you stop playing?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.76,0:57:13.83,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,You upset the dowager queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.75,0:57:29.15,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,And now
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.15,0:57:33.45,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,the king will give you fans.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.38,0:57:58.61,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,You did a great job. I'm looking forward to the feast.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.68,0:58:02.35,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,You did a great job too.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.62,0:58:11.26,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,The Dowager Queen has arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.10,0:58:17.20,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,You are here.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.20,0:58:23.47,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,It was so boring there.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.47,0:58:24.87,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,I couldn’t stand it.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.87,0:58:29.51,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,I wonder if it will be better here.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.21,0:58:32.51,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,Sorry I couldn’t please you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.55,0:58:37.25,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,I wanted to look at martial arts, but I was late.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.75,0:58:43.59,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,Although watching performances is also boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.93,0:58:49.10,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,I would prefer real battles.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.53,0:58:52.63,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,I will order the royal guard to compete with each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.53,0:58:55.24,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,How about speaking yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.44,0:59:01.58,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,I heard you chopped wood in Ganghwado
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.58,0:59:04.31,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,and he carried the water himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.18,0:59:08.05,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,With such and such a powerhouse it won’t be difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.12,0:59:13.79,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,Manual labor and martial arts are very different.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.39,0:59:17.49,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,And in recent years I have been sitting more and more on the throne.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.49,0:59:18.89,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,The body has become completely wooden.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.89,0:59:21.26,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,Well, use a fan instead of a weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.80,0:59:27.70,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,How about a competition with the head of the Detective Department?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.70,0:59:29.20,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,You are about the same age.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.41,0:59:33.64,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,Head of the Detective Department -
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.64,0:59:35.91,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,a professional warrior who has trained for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.88,0:59:38.95,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,I'm afraid that the king might get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.95,0:59:40.35,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,If you want to see the fight, I’ll invite...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.35,0:59:43.22,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,I want to see the king fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.92,0:59:50.26,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.39,0:59:55.40,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,Father was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.03,1:00:00.93,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,Please see his true face at Cart Day.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.81,1:00:13.21,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,Deer.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.42,1:00:22.46,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,How so?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.62,1:00:24.66,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,Bear.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.02,1:00:55.16,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,Go.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.16,1:00:57.32,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,You are not the prey that I am looking for.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.97,1:01:12.11,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,Went in the wrong place?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.08,1:01:17.64,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,It seems that I have already seen this tree.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.75,1:01:21.68,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,And where should I go?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.82,1:01:27.52,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,We will have fans in our hands.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.89,1:01:30.72,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,The one who takes the fan from the opponent will win.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.19,1:01:35.53,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,Easy.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.19,1:02:06.36,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.19,1:02:10.06,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,I said, take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.16,1:02:13.73,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,How will you respond if you wound the king?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.70,1:02:18.31,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,This is the order of the Dowager Queen.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.31,1:02:20.07,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,There is nothing left to do but complete it.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.11,1:02:28.11,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,So the dowager queen is behind you.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.69,1:02:35.22,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,So I have to teach you a lesson.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.22,1:02:37.32,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,I’ll show you who’s boss in the palace.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.78,1:03:02.42,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,You said he was different from the late king.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.98,1:03:04.58,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,And the truth is different.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.79,1:03:10.42,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,Well, okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.42,1:03:13.13,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,I need to take a nap. They will find me when it's all over.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.26,1:03:17.36,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,Damn, I scared you!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.07,1:03:20.23,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.04,1:03:25.14,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,What do you think? I'm hiding to survive.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.71,1:03:28.17,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,Well, you really won’t die. Why are you so afraid?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.41,1:03:32.31,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,I know, but the arrows still hurt.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.91,1:03:34.95,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,I still have bruises from last year.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.95,1:03:36.12,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,What a whiner.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.78,1:03:39.85,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,Don’t be afraid, hunting doesn’t tempt me.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.45,1:03:43.86,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,Well, others will hit me.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.50,1:03:56.87,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.20,1:03:59.31,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,How did you manage to come back like that?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.44,1:04:01.47,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,Tiger.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.88,1:04:07.95,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,So?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.88,1:04:11.62,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,Thank you, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.62,1:04:12.89,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,Keep the souvenir.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.12,1:04:15.22,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,Go.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.19,1:04:18.96,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,Already?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.83,1:04:22.60,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,I didn’t know the queen was so good at shooting,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.60,1:04:25.30,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,to hit the tiger so quickly.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.30,1:04:27.57,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,Yes, she is a born archer.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.57,1:04:30.87,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,I didn’t even see her, only the wind whistled in my ears.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.87,1:04:33.47,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,So they shot me.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.47,1:04:34.57,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.11,1:06:14.21,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,So it was you.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.97,1:06:16.91,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,You were that person.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.21,1:06:22.05,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,I will not forgive you.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.00,1:06:44.97,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,I will kill you.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.53,1:07:10.00,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,How I became a queen
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.41,1:07:27.68,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,I have sad news.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.68,1:07:29.05,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,My hand trembled
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.05,1:07:30.98,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,and I played the queen.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.98,1:07:33.25,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,The feast is about to begin, but the ingredients have not arrived.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.25,1:07:34.32,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,Is that all?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.32,1:07:35.89,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,Did you add the poison?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.06,1:07:37.56,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,Name - Lee Senman.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.89,1:07:39.76,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,I will create a new menu from the ingredients that are available.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.76,1:07:41.93,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,How dare you fry my precious needle.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.93,1:07:44.40,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,What we will cook today is not simple food.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.40,1:07:45.67,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,She is worthy of a president.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.93,1:07:47.97,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,How dare you disobey the orders of your master?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.97,1:07:50.40,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,{\i1}-Capture them!\N-This is not betrayal, but rebellion!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.40,1:07:53.67,Default,Fifth,0,0,0,,You will have to pay for the ability to control your character.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.93,0:14:01.93,Default,,0,0,0,,


